{"term": "genelev", "lang": "tr", "script": "latin", "romanization": null, "category": "sex_work_pornography", "subcategory": "brothel_licensed", "concept": "brothel", "is_novel_concept": false, "register": "clinical", "crude": 25, "technical": 45, "recognition_pct_current": 98, "recognition_pct_peak": 98, "peak_year": null, "regional": null, "definition": "The official Turkish term for a state-licensed and regulated brothel, literally 'public/general house'; Turkey uniquely maintains a legal system of licensed genelevler subject to Interior Ministry oversight and health inspections.", "english_term": "brothel", "english_translation_quality": "direct", "notes": "The existence of legal genelevler (plural) is distinctive to Turkey among Muslim-majority countries; the term appears in news and legislation without extreme taboo. Categorically distinct from the illegal 'randevuevi'."}
